        "publisherDisplayName": "FireCompass",
        "descriptionHtml": "<p><strong>Note:</strong> Please refer to the following before installing the solution:</p>\n<p>• Review the solution <a href=\"https://github.com/Azure/Azure-Sentinel/tree/master/Solutions/FireCompassRisks/ReleaseNotes.md\">Release Notes</a></p>\n<p>• There may be <a href=\"https://aka.ms/sentinelsolutionsknownissues\">known issues</a> pertaining to this Solution, please refer to them before installing.</p>\n<p>The FireCompass Risks solution provides real-time risk finding ingestion from the FireCompass platform into Microsoft Sentinel using the Codeless Connector Framework (CCF) Push pattern. The FireCompass platform pushes risk records (severity, state, asset, assessment context, and remediation guidance) directly to Azure Monitor for analysis, alerting, and closed-loop remediation.</p>\n<p><strong>Data Connectors:</strong> 1</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://aka.ms/azuresentinel\">Learn more about Microsoft Sentinel</a> | <a href=\"https://aka.ms/azuresentinelsolutionsdoc\">Learn more about Solutions</a></p>\n",
